# Verify Emergency Broadcast Alert Modal and Pick on Map
1. Open http://localhost:3000/authority-login.html
2. Click on the "Sign In" button to enter the Authority Portal.
3. Click on the "Broadcast Alert" button in the top right corner of the command center.
4. Verify that the "Broadcast Emergency Alert" modal is visible.
5. Click on the "Pick on Map" button inside the modal.
6. Verify that the "Select Location" map overlay appears.
7. Click anywhere on the map to select a coordinate.
8. Click on the "Confirm Location" button.
9. Verify that the latitude and longitude fields in the alert form have been populated with numbers.
